To fix the "Request contains an invalid argument" error in the Live API connection, I will correct the configuration for audio transcription in `services/liveApi.ts`. The Gemini Live API expects empty objects `{}` to enable transcription with default settings, rather than specifying a model name like `'google_speech'`.

I will also update the `systemInstruction` formatting to ensure it is compliant.

# Updated files:

## services/liveApi.ts

